  "distinctTestDeclarations": [
    "Cupid: two policies keep mixed members separate from identity and include only declared dead or living winners",
    "Cupid: selecting the actor gives both source policies exactly the two declared relationship members",
    "Cupid: same-Wolf pair changes membership without changing the independent Cupid's Good identity",
    "Cupid: failed checkpoint keeps bound relation, debit, partial ordered membership and partial publication",
    "Cupid: pre-commit death fact is not physical death; forged recognition, duplicate death and suppressed gun are rejected",
    "Cupid: retry request contract, private recognition and unrecorded hidden data remain distinct",
    "Hybrid: frozen Wolf membership survives both deaths while role and actual Camp stay Good",
    "Hybrid: Good target has independent Good affiliation and Wolf-half cannot count the follower as a real wolf",
    "Hybrid: failed checkpoint accepts debit-before-choice and install-before-fact without refund",
    "Hybrid: foreign target, forged hidden camp, repeated facts and leaked knowledge reject independently",
    "strict assembly adds rejection after the original sixteen; historical public reader remains separate",
    "Cupid: opaque settlement error or pending preserves the literal paid prefix without inventing a recorded reply",
    "Hybrid: opaque settlement error or pending preserves consumed selection while recorded-only conflicts still reject"
  ],
